<div class="document">
  <header class="doc-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="doc-body about-page">

<p>My name is Jared Foy. I am a web developer with a penchant for hypermedia-first construction styles. I live in southern Oregon, in a valley surrounded by the Siskiyou Mountains with my wife and four kids.</p>

<p>I have a garden and a compost pile. I engage informally with AI research and dabble with a <a href="/resolve">"coherence sphere"</a> (see <a href="/resolve/about-the-project">About the Project</a> for what the project actually is and what its outputs warrant). I enjoy taking walks at lunch time and I drink too much coffee.</p>

<p>I'd love to chat — reach out to me at the form below or follow me on X at <a href="https://x.com/jaredef" rel="me">@jaredef</a>.</p>

<h2>Say hello</h2>

<form id="contactForm" class="contact-form">
  <label>
    <span>Your name</span>
    <input type="text" id="cf_name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
  </label>
  <label>
    <span>Your email (optional)</span>
    <input type="email" id="cf_email" name="email" autocomplete="email">
  </label>
  <label>
    <span>Message</span>
    <textarea id="cf_message" name="message" rows="6" required></textarea>
  </label>
  <button type="submit" class="contact-submit">Send</button>
  <p class="contact-hint">Opens your default email client with the message pre-filled.</p>
</form>

<script>
(function() {
  var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
  if (!form) return;
  form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    var name = document.getElementById('cf_name').value.trim();
    var email = document.getElementById('cf_email').value.trim();
    var message = document.getElementById('cf_message').value.trim();
    if (!name || !message) return;
    // Construct a mailto: URL. Email is not embedded in page source —
    // assembled only at submit time.
    var to = ['jared', '@', 'jaredfoy.com'].join('');
    var subject = 'Hello from ' + name + ' (jaredfoy.com)';
    var body = message + '\n\n—\n' + name + (email ? ' <' + email + '>' : '');
    var href = 'mailto:' + to +
      '?subject=' + encodeURIComponent(subject) +
      '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(body);
    window.location.href = href;
  });
})();
</script>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
.about-page { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem 1.25rem 4rem; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; }
.about-page p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.about-page h2 { margin: 2rem 0 1rem; font-size: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.03em; }
.about-page a { color: var(--accent, #ff8800); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,136,0,0.3); }
.about-page a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--accent, #ff8800); }

.contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
.contact-form label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }
.contact-form label span { font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.7; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.contact-form input,
.contact-form textarea {
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
  background: var(--input-bg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03));
  color: inherit;
  border: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(200,200,220,0.2));
  border-radius: 3px;
  outline: none;
}
.contact-form input:focus,
.contact-form textarea:focus { border-color: var(--accent, #ff8800); }
.contact-form textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 6rem; font-family: inherit; }
.contact-submit {
  align-self: flex-start;
  font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem; font-size: 0.9rem;
  background: var(--accent, #ff8800); color: #0a0a0f; border: none; border-radius: 3px;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.contact-submit:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }
.contact-hint { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.55; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
.theme-light .contact-form input,
.theme-light .contact-form textarea { background: #fffdf5; border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.15); }
</style>
